    <seoTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[Có người đang đe dọa, ép buộc bạn]]></Value>
    </seoTitle>
    <steps>
      <Value><![CDATA[[
  {
    "key": "347dd5d9-9d07-5034-a386-5901fed16844",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n \u0111ang b\u1ECB \u0111e d\u1ECDa t\u00EDnh m\u1EA1ng, s\u1EE9c kh\u1ECFe, ho\u1EB7c c\u00F3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u00ECm \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EADn n\u01A1i: g\u1ECDi 113 ngay.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      ""
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": [
      {
        "key": "757e42a2-4f09-5df0-a9cd-8de8b413937c",
        "label": "G\u1ECDi 113",
        "url": "tel:113"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "0e06b954-dad4-5558-aec3-761c53a15454",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "N\u00F3i cho m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u00E2n m\u00E0 b\u1EA1n tin c\u1EADy bi\u1EBFt ngay h\u00F4m nay.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "S\u1EE9c \u00E9p c\u1EE7a k\u1EBB \u0111e d\u1ECDa d\u1EF1a v\u00E0o vi\u1EC7c b\u1EA1n gi\u1EEF k\u00EDn v\u00E0 t\u1EF1 xoay x\u1EDF.",
      "N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n \u0111ang th\u1EA5y qu\u00E1 c\u0103ng th\u1EB3ng, h\u00E3y n\u00F3i v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u00F3 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, r\u1ED3i m\u1EDBi l\u00E0m c\u00E1c b\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u00F2n l\u1EA1i. Kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 b\u01B0\u1EDBc n\u00E0o \u1EDF \u0111\u00E2y quan tr\u1ECDng h\u01A1n vi\u1EC7c b\u1EA1n c\u00F3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u00EAn c\u1EA1nh."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "495ebd13-fca0-563b-aa17-72949d4b1b14",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "Kh\u00F4ng chuy\u1EC3n th\u00EAm ti\u1EC1n theo y\u00EAu c\u1EA7u \u0111e d\u1ECDa.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "Tr\u1EA3 ti\u1EC1n kh\u00F4ng b\u1EA3o \u0111\u1EA3m l\u1EDDi \u0111e d\u1ECDa s\u1EBD d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i.",
      "N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n \u0111\u00E3 l\u1EE1 tr\u1EA3 r\u1ED3i th\u00EC c\u0169ng kh\u00F4ng sao \u2014 \u0111i\u1EC1u \u0111\u00F3 kh\u00F4ng l\u00E0m b\u1EA1n m\u1EA5t quy\u1EC1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u00FAp \u0111\u1EE1, v\u00E0 kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 g\u00EC ph\u1EA3i ng\u1EA1i khi tr\u00ECnh b\u00E1o."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "262932f4-fdaa-5ac2-aa3d-3a332e1ca8a6",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "Kh\u00F4ng t\u1EF1 th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng, kh\u00F4ng h\u1EE9a h\u1EB9n th\u00EAm, v\u00E0 kh\u00F4ng g\u1EEDi th\u00EAm b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 th\u00F4ng tin, h\u00ECnh \u1EA3nh hay gi\u1EA5y t\u1EDD n\u00E0o n\u1EEFa.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      ""
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "f6780b92-aa69-58e8-ab7b-b22add97ef2f",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "N\u1EBFu l\u00E0m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nhanh v\u00E0 b\u1EA1n th\u1EA5y an to\u00E0n: ch\u1EE5p l\u1EA1i b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng \u2014 tin nh\u1EAFn, cu\u1ED9c g\u1ECDi, s\u1ED1 t\u00E0i kho\u1EA3n h\u1ECD \u0111\u00F2i chuy\u1EC3n, ng\u00E0y gi\u1EDD \u2014 r\u1ED3i ng\u1EEBng tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi ho\u1EB7c ch\u1EB7n.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "Ch\u1EB7n r\u1ED3i th\u00EC ph\u1EA7n l\u1EDBn b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng kh\u00F4ng l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c, n\u00EAn ch\u1EE5p tr\u01B0\u1EDBc n\u1EBFu k\u1ECBp.",
      "Nh\u01B0ng n\u1EBFu vi\u1EC7c ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c li\u00EAn l\u1EA1c khi\u1EBFn b\u1EA1n th\u1EA5y kh\u00F4ng an to\u00E0n ho\u1EB7c qu\u00E1 c\u0103ng th\u1EB3ng, h\u00E3y ng\u1EEBng li\u00EAn l\u1EA1c tr\u01B0\u1EDBc. An to\u00E0n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EE9ng tr\u00EAn b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "8ca53cd5-28b2-5a29-af37-73135f269fc1",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "N\u1EBFu h\u1ECD d\u1ECDa g\u1ECDi cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi trong danh b\u1EA1 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, h\u00E3y b\u00E1o tr\u01B0\u1EDBc cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u00E2n, b\u1EA1n b\u00E8.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "N\u00F3i v\u1EDBi h\u1ECD r\u1EB1ng c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 c\u00F3 cu\u1ED9c g\u1ECDi nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy, v\u00E0 \u0111\u00F3 c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 l\u00E0 cu\u1ED9c g\u1ECDi qu\u1EA5y r\u1ED1i ho\u1EB7c \u0111e d\u1ECDa. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u00E1o tr\u01B0\u1EDBc s\u1EBD kh\u00F4ng hoang mang. \u0110\u1EEBng tranh lu\u1EADn v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi g\u1ECDi v\u1EC1 danh ngh\u0129a c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "1eb68f3f-e2fb-5ac0-a175-ffcdc9435f84",
    "isNotice": false,
    "mainText": "\u0110\u1EBFn C\u00F4ng an n\u01A1i g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t ho\u1EB7c n\u01A1i b\u1EA1n c\u01B0 tr\u00FA \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u00ECnh b\u00E1o. Mang theo nh\u1EEFng g\u00EC b\u1EA1n \u0111ang c\u00F3.",
    "noticeTitle": "",
    "details": [
      "N\u1EBFu b\u1ECB \u0111e d\u1ECDa tung h\u00ECnh \u1EA3nh ho\u1EB7c th\u00F4ng tin ri\u00EAng t\u01B0 \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u00F2i ti\u1EC1n: ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECB \u0111e d\u1ECDa l\u00E0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECB h\u1EA1i. \u0110\u1EEBng g\u1EEDi th\u00EAm, \u0111\u1EEBng tr\u1EA3 th\u00EAm, h\u00E3y tr\u00ECnh b\u00E1o."
    ],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "key": "b5aa4fae-92b1-515c-a2be-962e31fb58a9",
    "isNotice": true,
    "mainText": "",
    "noticeTitle": "Quy t\u1EAFc d\u00F9ng cho m\u1ECDi tr\u01B0\u1EDDng h\u1EE3p c\u00F2n l\u1EA1i",
    "details": [],
    "sampleScript": "",
    "showBankLookup": false,
    "hasFollowUp": false,
    "links": [],
    "snippetAfter": "umb://document/2553dcb3bd03593a99b81ac873c0f0f4"
  }
]]]></Value>
